{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QZfBsdecCF5ryBsjjwDTt4","type":"tool_result","content":"4:{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-6\",\"id\":\"msg_01VuguwCup1MkAdXxCnzar3U\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"## Project State Summary\\n\\n**Problem**: go-unix-utils reimplements GNU coreutils/moreutils in Go, testing a specification-driven AI code generation methodology. SRDs derived from C source drive Go implementations verified via differential testing against Homebrew GNU reference binaries.\\n\\n**Architecture**: `cmd/<name>/` per utility (main.go + tests), `pkg/testutils/` (differential testing harness), `pkg/sys/` (syscall abstractions), `pkg/format/` (output formatting), plus `pkg/hashutil/`, `pkg/sizeparse/`, `pkg/encutil/` shared libraries.\\n\\n**Current state**: Generation run 44 is active. Foundational infrastructure (rel00.0) and releases through rel03.1 are complete. Recent commits completed srd052-tty (rel04.1). SRDs absent from requirement_states have no ready requirements and are treated as complete.\\n\\n**Earliest incomplete release**: rel04.1 -- path and terminal utilities. Ready requirements:\\n- srd051-pwd: 1 requirement (R3.3) -- pwd mostly implemented, small completion\\n- srd050-readlink: 13 requirements (R1.1-R1.6, R2.1-R2.2, R3.1-R3.2, R4.1-R4.3) -- not started\\n- srd049-realpath: 14 requirements -- not started\\n\\nCanonical ordering: cmd/pwd < cmd/readlink < cmd/realpath.\\n\\n## Weight Budget Analysis\\n\\nAssuming weight 1 per requirement (requirements.yaml not available in context; readlink and pwd are medium-complexity utilities):\\n\\n- Task 0: srd051-pwd R3.3(w=1) = 1 <= 4\\n- Task 1: srd050-readlink R1.1(1) + R1.2(1) + R1.3(1) + R1.4(1) = 4 <= 4\\n- Task 2: srd050-readlink R1.5(1) + R1.6(1) + R2.1(1) + R2.2(1) = 4 <= 4\\n- Task 3: srd050-readlink R3.1(1) + R3.2(1) + R4.1(1) + R4.2(1) = 4 <= 4\\n\\nRemaining for next batch: srd050-readlink R4.3, all of srd049-realpath.\\n\\n```yaml\\n- index: 0\\n  title: \\\"[stitch] cmd/pwd: features implementation (srd051-pwd R3.3)\\\"\\n  dependency: -1\\n  description: |\\n    deliverable_type: code\\n\\n    required_reading:\\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd051-pwd.yaml (requirement R3.3 specification)\\n      - cmd/pwd/main.go (existing pwd implementation to modify)\\n      - cmd/pwd/pwd_test.go (existing differential test file to update)\\n      - pkg/testutils/difftest.go (DiffTest struct and RunDiffTests function)\\n\\n    files:\\n      - path: cmd/pwd/main.go\\n        action: modify\\n        note: Add R3.3 feature to existing pwd implementation\\n      - path: cmd/pwd/pwd_test.go\\n        action: modify\\n        note: Add differential test cases for R3.3\\n\\n    requirements:\\n      - id: R1\\n        text: \\\"Implement srd051-pwd requirement R3.3 as specified in the SRD\\\"\\n\\n    design_decisions:\\n      - id: D1\\n        text: \\\"Follow the existing code patterns in cmd/pwd/main.go\\\"\\n      - id: D2\\n        text: \\\"Use pkg/testutils.RunDiffTests for differential testing against gpwd\\\"\\n      - id: D3\\n        text: \\\"Set LC_ALL=C in all differential test environments\\\"\\n\\n    acceptance_criteria:\\n      - id: AC1\\n        text: \\\"srd051-pwd requirement R3.3 is implemented per the SRD\\\"\\n      - id: AC2\\n        text: \\\"go build -o bin/pwd ./cmd/pwd/ succeeds with no errors\\\"\\n      - id: AC3\\n        text: \\\"go vet ./cmd/pwd/ reports no issues\\\"\\n      - id: AC4\\n        text: \\\"go test ./cmd/pwd/... -count=1 passes\\\"\\n\\n- index: 1\\n  title: \\\"[stitch] cmd/readlink: features implementation (srd050-readlink R1.1-R1.4)\\\"\\n  dependency: -1\\n  description: |\\n    deliverable_type: code\\n\\n    required_reading:\\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd050-readlink.yaml (requirements R1.1 through R1.4)\\n      - pkg/sys/ (InstallSIGPIPEHandler function